# Keep every text file LF in the repository, whatever the author's OS does
# locally. The deploy workflow was once written as UTF-16 with CR endings by a
# PowerShell redirect, which made it unreadable in diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.keystore binary
*.apk binary
*.pdf binary
